  "prefLabel": "Env-Wt 510.06 Design Requirements for EAW Control Projects",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 510.06 Design Requirements for EAW Control Projects. In addition to meeting applicable design requirements established in Env-Wt 307, a proposed project to remove or otherwise control EAW shall be:\n\n(a) Designed to comply with all applicable requirements of RSA 487 and Env-Wq 1300; and\n\n(b) Developed in consultation with the department’s invasive species coordinator and watershed bureau.\n\nSource. #12805, eff 12-15-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wt500.html"
